plan error: LogicalPlanError: Query planning error: size([x IN list WHERE (pattern)]) is only supported when the pattern is a single directed hop starting at the iteration variable (e.g. `(x)-[:REL]->()` or `(x)<-[:REL]-()`); a target-position, undirected, or multi-hop pattern would return a wrong count and is not yet supported (#629). Workaround: correlate the pattern to an outer variable, or express the constrained count via a top-level MATCH ... WHERE ... WITH count(...).